<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 11.47 to 5877.36.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite fell 0.99 to 363.44.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.10.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1346 to 951.</p>
<p>Volume was 395,811,840, compared with 442,580,110 Tuesday.</p>
